{:edb/db-before-t 2453 :edb/db-after-t 2454 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535766 50 #inst "2026-10-09T06:48:57.473Z" 13194139535766 true] [17592186198312 1020 #edb/ref 17592186365255 13194139535766 true] [17592186198321 1020 #edb/ref 17592186365241 13194139535766 true] [17592186198321 1020 #edb/ref 17592186365248 13194139535766 true] [17592186198535 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535766 true] [17592186198535 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡z\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz=$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186198535 1100 "What is $∫_{0}^{π/2}∫_{0}^{2}∫_{1}^{4}\\cos zdxdydz$?" 13194139535766 false] [17592186198535 1145 "Since the domain of integration $R=[1,4]\\times [0,2]\\times [0,\\pi /2]$ is a rectangular box and the integrand can be expressed as $f(x)\\cdot g(y)\\cdot h(z),$ we can rewrite our repeated integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡z\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\,dx{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\,dy{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡z\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating each integral separately, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\,dx{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\,dy{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡z\\,dz & =(4-1)\\cdot (2-0)\\cdot [\\operatorname{sin}⁡z]_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 2\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =6\\cdot (1-0) \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186198536 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535766 true] [17592186198536 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{x}2{e}^{z+1}\\,dz\\,dx\\,dy=$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186198536 1100 "What is $∫_{0}^{1}∫_{-y}^{0}∫_{0}^{x}2e^{z + 1}dzdxdy$?" 13194139535766 false] [17592186198536 1145 "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $z,$ treating $x$ and $y$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{x}2{e}^{z+1}\\,dz\\,dx\\,dy & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{0}[{\\int }_{0}^{x}2{e}^{z+1}\\,dz]dx\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{0}2[{e}^{z+1}]_{z=0}^{z=x}\\,dx\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{0}2({e}^{x+1}-e)\\,dx\\,dy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x,$ treating $y$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{0}2({e}^{x+1}-e)\\,dx\\,dy & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[2{\\int }_{-y}^{0}{e}^{x+1}-e\\,dx]dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}2[{e}^{x+1}-ex]_{x=-y}^{x=0}\\,dy \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{0+1}-e(0)-({e}^{-y+1}-e(-y))dy \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}e-{e}^{1-y}-ey\\,dy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{\\int }_{0}^{1}e-{e}^{1-y}-ey\\,dy & =2{[ey+{e}^{1-y}-\\frac{e}{2}{y}^{2}]}_{y=0}^{y=1} \\\\  & =2(e(1-0)+{e}^{1-1}-{e}^{1-0}-\\frac{e}{2}({1}^{2}-{0}^{2})) \\\\  & =2(e+1-e-\\frac{e}{2}) \\\\  & =2-e\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365241 1017 #edb/ref 17592186365242 13194139535766 true] [17592186365241 1089 "q-161269" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365241 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535766 true] [17592186365241 1100 "${\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{1}x{y}^{2}{z}^{3}\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y=$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365241 1113 #uuid "283cdf8c-c107-502f-8e66-6810691011a0" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365241 1145 "Since the domain of integration $R=[0,4]\\times [1,2]\\times [0,1]$ is a rectangular box and the integrand can be expressed as $f(x)\\cdot g(y)\\cdot h(z),$ we can rewrite our repeated integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{1}x{y}^{2}{z}^{3}\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}x\\,dx{\\int }_{1}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,dy{\\int }_{0}^{1}{z}^{3}\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating each integral separately, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}x\\,dx{\\int }_{1}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,dy{\\int }_{0}^{1}{z}^{3}\\,dz & ={[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{4}\\cdot {[\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{3}]}_{1}^{2}\\cdot {[\\frac{1}{4}{z}^{4}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =(8-0)\\cdot (\\frac{8}{3}-\\frac{1}{3})\\cdot (\\frac{1}{4}-0) \\\\  & =8\\cdot \\frac{7}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365243 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365244 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365245 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365246 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365247 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1041 "selection" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1104 #edb/ref 17592186365243 13194139535766 true] [17592186365242 1110 #uuid "d35092d7-e125-5886-bea0-e211c6d92196" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365243 1034 "\\frac{14}{3}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365243 1111 #uuid "01b03add-0444-56ea-a19a-ac989629bcea" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365244 1034 "\\frac{21}{2}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365244 1111 #uuid "687912df-b52a-55fb-b50e-e7f2fda30b7c" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365245 1034 "\\frac{35}{6}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365245 1111 #uuid "7a7b5c7c-f132-59cd-9256-f654684f5b14" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365246 1034 "4" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365246 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365246 1111 #uuid "44baa4c6-de18-5146-8462-6ae1b0b37e0d" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365247 1034 "5" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365247 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365247 1111 #uuid "0847be0a-2ecf-5d2c-b9be-b5fab51f00d3" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365248 1017 #edb/ref 17592186365249 13194139535766 true] [17592186365248 1089 "q-161295" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365248 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535766 true] [17592186365248 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{e}{e}^{-z}\\,dy\\,dz\\,dx=$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365248 1113 #uuid "6873c098-2f5d-5723-abba-bfc2f14a77ac" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365248 1145 "Since the domain of integration $R=[0,2]\\times [0,e]\\times [0,1]$ is a rectangular box and the integrand can be expressed as $f(x)\\cdot g(y)\\cdot h(z),$ we can rewrite our repeated integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{e}{e}^{-z}\\,dy\\,dz\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}dx{\\int }_{0}^{e}dy{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{-z}\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating each integral separately, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}dx{\\int }_{0}^{e}dy{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{-z}\\,dz & =(2-0)\\cdot (e-0)\\cdot [-{e}^{-z}]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =2\\cdot e\\cdot (-{e}^{-1}+{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =2e(1-{e}^{-1}) \\\\  & =2e-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365250 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365251 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365252 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365253 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365254 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1041 "selection" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1104 #edb/ref 17592186365254 13194139535766 true] [17592186365249 1110 #uuid "4c842a99-4831-51a6-bb06-5707b68011df" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365250 1034 "{e}^{2}-2e" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365250 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365250 1111 #uuid "c1bbd036-3307-5246-9074-b7523ccdafa8" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365251 1034 "4-2e" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365251 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365251 1111 #uuid "94b37b6e-e045-54ba-ac63-494c3e3681c9" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365252 1034 "e-4" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365252 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365252 1111 #uuid "e9bf9218-4d15-54b2-b615-9878dff577b7" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365253 1034 "{e}^{2}-1" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365253 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365253 1111 #uuid "b97719b3-ee77-57f6-bc51-3ed63de4b6f0" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365254 1034 "2e-2" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365254 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365254 1111 #uuid "2342a0ce-bde6-5973-9225-be71278631ed" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365255 1017 #edb/ref 17592186365256 13194139535766 true] [17592186365255 1089 "q-162536" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365255 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535766 true] [17592186365255 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}{\\int }_{0}^{y}xyz\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx=$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365255 1113 #uuid "9afcd968-6275-532c-b4e4-869d34d53716" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365255 1145 "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $z,$ treating $x$ and $y$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}{\\int }_{0}^{y}xyz\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}[{\\int }_{0}^{y}xyz\\,dz]dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}{[\\frac{1}{2}xy{z}^{2}]}_{z=0}^{z=y}\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}xy({y}^{2}-0)\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}x{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $y,$ treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}x{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}x{y}^{3}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[\\frac{1}{8}x{y}^{4}]}_{y=0}^{y=x}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{8}x({x}^{4}-0)\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{5}\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{5}\\,dx & =\\frac{1}{8}{[\\frac{1}{6}{x}^{6}]}_{x=0}^{x=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{48}(64-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365257 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365258 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365259 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365260 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186365261 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1041 "selection" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1104 #edb/ref 17592186365259 13194139535766 true] [17592186365256 1110 #uuid "b1623a82-4242-52bf-96f1-a066ea237813" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365257 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365257 1111 #uuid "413e69f8-af3f-5c03-9e44-2b7a19d51104" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365258 1034 "2" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365258 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365258 1111 #uuid "00b2c4eb-53d0-535c-8782-556240454213" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365259 1034 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365259 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365259 1111 #uuid "c42a15ad-87f3-52fd-9a2b-140dfaf1bac0" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365260 1034 "\\frac{5}{3}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365260 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365260 1111 #uuid "9a483e68-03a4-5858-998e-8bc7a8f254d4" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365261 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535766 true] [17592186365261 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535766 true] [17592186365261 1111 #uuid "80c6febf-8958-5563-b7ac-7d8ee11fec98" 13194139535766 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-161269" 17592186365241 "q-161269/selectio